    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一个动作，你可以在你持握这张卡片期间说出命令语，使你在其后的1分钟内在魅力（威吓或游说）检定上具有优势。此外，在特性生效期间，你可以用一个动作从这张卡片施放<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.new-icon.Item.Ja6HpsLeGA9MQ0Rm]{命令术command}</em>（豁免DC 17）。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can speak a command word while holding this card to gain advantage on Charisma (&amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation] or &amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion]) checks for 1 minute. In addition, for that duration, you can use this card to cast the @spell[Command] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">17</span>) as an action. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
